@startuml
title Resumefolio | Draft record refinement and evidence
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
 BorderColor #64748B
 FontColor #17324D
 DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
 DiamondBorderColor #B45309
 StartColor #17324D
 EndColor #17324D
}
start
:Copy template and replace placeholders with actual sourced information;
:Identify actor, resource, obligation / goal and primary criteria;
:Specify conditions, expected outcomes and relevant exception paths;
if (Required policy / data / dependency decisions complete?) then (yes)
 :Review record, links and models against an identified revision;
 :Record actual observations, findings and owner disposition;
 :Later perform only appropriate authorized controlled checks;
 :Retain actual candidate / environment / outcomes and limitations; <<#DCFCE7>>
else (pending)
 :Record unresolved question, owner, action and dependent gate; <<#FEF3C7>>
 :Keep affected acceptance / execution readiness pending;
endif
stop
legend bottom
Template guidance only: no record ID, policy or acceptance allocated.
Expected outcomes and planned methods are not actual results.
A story, criterion, scenario and test result have distinct responsibilities.
endlegend
@enduml
